  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1100857167872
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1349482926080
    m_Localized: new game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1449852620800
    m_Localized: Exit game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9481856700416
    m_Localized: "\n\n\n\n\nthe world is divided into 4 continents, the human continent,
      the metamorph contient, the witch continent and the monster continent.\n\nThere
      are 3 main cities in the human continent, Moonshine, Riverspring and Skyridge.
      In each city, there is a castle govern by the queen and the king.\n\nThere
      is also a lot of donjons in the humain continent. In those donjons, a lot of
      monsters appears regulary. It is said that those monster came from the continent
      of monsters.\n\nIn old times, humans developped their technology and build
      boats to explore the others continents. \n\nThe continent of monsters is unknown
      because it was too difficult to reach. It is named like that because people
      think that the monsters that appears in the donjons came from this continent.\n\nThe
      witch continent is not very known because the witches protect their secrets.
      But they like to go to other continent to sell some products.\n\nthe metamorph
      continent is the most known. Event though some places has not been explored
      because it is to difficult for the human to access or the people protect the
      place. We know 4 metamorph clan, the wolf clan, the snake clan, the bird clan
      and the feline clan. There are some rumors that said that there is a dragon
      clan somewhere but nobody saw them.\n\nThe contacts with the wolf clan was
      good. But it was more difficult with the others. Some humans were afraid of
      the metamorphs and some metamorphs, especially the snake clan didn't like the
      humans.\n \nA conflict started between the humans, the wolf clan, the snake
      clan and the bird clan. During the fights, the city of Riverspring was destroyed.\n\nBut
      thanks to a group of heros from the humans, the wolf clan and the witches,
      the conflict ended.\n\nAfter the conflict, a peace was found between people.\n\nSome
      humans and wolf tried to keep a good understanding between people but some
      humans that saw the powers of metamorphs was scared of them and didn't want
      to be with them.\nThe bird clan disapeared to not be seen by humans. The snake
      clan doesn't like the humans and was in conflict with the wolf clan because
      of that.\n\n\nThis is where our story begins."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2508299206610944
    m_Localized: n-Man
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2508350255484928
    m_Localized: Some enemies have weaknesses or resistance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2508916822069248
    m_Localized: You need to take that in account during your fights
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2509626947096576
    m_Localized: n-Mom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2509676406329344
    m_Localized: Don't forget to go to the shop to buy new equipment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2509990035410944
    m_Localized: Yes Mom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510041914757120
    m_Localized: n-Mom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510117785522176
    m_Localized: And remember to always have heal potion with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510567993724928
    m_Localized: Okay.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510595478999040
    m_Localized: n-Mom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510619780796416
    m_Localized: If you're hurt, go see your grandpa or Rose. They will heal you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2511016591314944
    m_Localized: Don't worry mom. I'll be okay.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2511237878599680
    m_Localized: n-Mom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2511289686642688
    m_Localized: I'm sorry, but I want to make sure that you've got everything you
      need.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2511865744936960
    m_Localized: I'm gonna heal you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2511986490560512
    m_Localized: Good luck
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2512177146843136
    m_Localized: Don't forget to always have heal potion with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2513158580424704
    m_Localized: I feer the worst. Marco, go see what is happening.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2513358975881216
    m_Localized: This story is really incredible.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2513556468879360
    m_Localized: I wonder why they've been accused of th attack of the king of Moonshine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2514318427115520
    m_Localized: I have a feeling there's something behind this story.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2521080626630656
    m_Localized: Oh No !  They  found us !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2521226127036416
    m_Localized: I knew we  shouldn't  have came here. You will be in trouble because
      of you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2521908120866816
    m_Localized: He is badly hurt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2522333721088000
    m_Localized: So Marco, are you ready to begin your training to become a knight
      ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2522909741633536
    m_Localized: Yes, but I have still a training today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2523308015964160
    m_Localized: Good ! Here are some health potion. It will be usefull for your
      battles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2524459075588096
    m_Localized: Thanks grandpa.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2524566428798976
    m_Localized: Don't hesitate to came see us if you're hurt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2525281280806912
    m_Localized: You can change your equipment by going to the menu and clicking
      on the "objects" button.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2525943523659776
    m_Localized: You can open the menu by clicking "tab" button.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2526257312124928
    m_Localized: Don't also forget to save your game regulary.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2526798910017536
    m_Localized: The potions can restore you HP ou MP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2527120055291904
    m_Localized: Elixir can also heal you if you're K.O.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2527832839507968
    m_Localized: n-Girl
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2527899268894720
    m_Localized: There is a donjon near the village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2528057410932736
    m_Localized: It is said that there are monster in it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2528518918590464
    m_Localized: n-Woman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2528574597976064
    m_Localized: This village is peaceful.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2528762637012992
    m_Localized: n-Woman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2529184407834624
    m_Localized: If you go outside the village, take some potions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2529414800953344
    m_Localized: You can buy some in the shop at the bottom of the village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2530702607470592
    m_Localized: n-Man
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2530770894934016
    m_Localized: What could I bake today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2531337893531648
    m_Localized: Let's go training to be ready for tommorow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2531806456008704
    m_Localized: You can't go to the forest right now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2531952908521472
    m_Localized: It is dangerous to go outside the village alone !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3036455445417984
    m_Localized: The village of apprentice knights
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
